# Guard WIP DMU (Dancing Mad Ultimate) sequential-trigger crashes that abort the
# sequence and silence every callout after them: confettis.get(0) on an empty list
# (ArrayIndexOutOfBounds, three sites), anyEntropy with no null-check, and the
# tether/glowing-hand/gaze Position reads that NPE when a combatant's position is
# unknown (NullPointerException). A null position now defaults the comparison to
# false instead of killing the invocation.
#
# Also stop filtering the boss fake/real element headmarkers by
# getTarget().npcIdMatches(19504): on some pulls the Kefka combatant never gets an
# npc id populated, the wait then runs into the 120s multiInvocation timeout and
# every Graven Image / look-away element callout is silently dropped. Filter by
# the marker ids (673-678) instead, which only ever appear on the boss for these
# mechanics. Against the event-trigger pin in build.sh. Upstream candidate.
